  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research on interreligious and intercultural tolerance in Niger</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Amongst the numerous actions listed under the EC  project is to conduct an in-depth and comprehensive research.  Firstly, the research will be designed to identify the barriers, challenges and enablers of cultural and religious pluralism in the target regions and plausible underlying mechanisms. Secondly, the quantitative and qualitative data collected will serve as a baseline for the action. The research will inform the design of project activities, including the selection of core themes which will be disseminated throughout the action. It will provide the missing empirical evidence to design advocacy activities including identifying influential spaces for CSOs and areas of advocacy with public duty bearers.</narrative>
  </description>
